  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>From the given information in the question we can draw the following diagram</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a3c30d0f-bf05-4e9d-ba20-e30a02a442de-image.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 172px;\" /></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
